  "liner": {
   "body_md": "## Setlist highlights\n\n- **I Will Be There When You Die/Sunrides And The Girls Scream**: earliest performance in the archive; legendary: the only archived performance [4]\n\n## The recordings\n\n- **mmj2000-04-05.b.fm.flac16** (recommended): FM broadcast; 6 songs; 29 min; rated 5/5 by 1 [1]. Said about its sound: Sounds like taken from at least two different broadcasts [1]\n- **mmj2000-04-05.a.fm.flac16**: FM broadcast; 4 songs; 20 min [2]\n\n## Around the show\n\n- Recording contains six of twelve tracks from Dutch Kink FM session [1]\n- Recording contains four of twelve tracks from Dutch Kink FM session [2]\n\n## Tapers and lineage\n\n- **mmj2000-04-05.b.fm.flac16**: taped by unknown; transferred by Magnix; source: FM > ? > CD-R > CD-R [1]. Also: Audio path: FM to CD-R, then CoolEditPro, EAC, and FLAC level 8 [1]\n- **mmj2000-04-05.a.fm.flac16**: taped by Riny van E.; transferred by Magnix; source: FM > Cassette > Cassette [2]. Also: Audio path: FM to cassette, then CoolEditPro, EAC, and FLAC level 8 [2]",
